{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54766","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 二十五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 二十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军营内，星陨作驴鸣（京本作「形」）。\n兆是（京本作「此兆」）败军幷杀将，便须移寨不须（京本作「当返不当」）停，天意甚分明。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}